              "name": "Interaction rule",
              "x": 282,
              "y": 454,
              "width": 170,
              "height": 138,
              "content": "Shared command router owns shortcuts. Scene, Hierarchy and Inspector share Undo/Redo. Multi-select marks differing values as Mixed; one bulk edit is one undoable action. Prefab context exposes overrides, refresh and conflicts.",
